  </svg>

  <figcaption id="ddd-bc-diagram-caption" class="ddd-bc-diagram__caption">
    圖解：限界上下文（Bounded Context）切割訊號與「萬能 User
    物件」解構為純淨多模型架構
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ddd-bc-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ddd-bc-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 960px;
  }

  .ddd-bc-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 360px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ddd-bc-diagram__desktop {
      display: none;
    }
